Additions and modifications, Copyright 2026 Luginfo10, under the same license:
  - SDL2 bindings, ABC music, soundfont and examples (ports/posix/sdl2*.fs, ports/web/sdl2*.fs, examples/)
  - ansi_compat.fs: standard ANS words missing from the core
  - Game Boy Advance port (ports/gba/)
  - Raspberry Pi Pico (RP2040) port (ports/pico/), adapted from the pico-ice port
  - Android ports: command line, WebView and native SDL2 (ports/android/), SDL console (ports/posix/sdl2_console.fs)
  - words reference tools (tools/words_*.py, WORDS.md)
  - text editors ed and writhdeck (ports/posix/editor.fs, writhdeck.fs, eval_copy.fs), after the author's WrithDeck
  - lugforth-mini, the POSIX build without editors, SDL2 and servers (ports/posix/posix_mini_boot.fs)
  - the line editor (common/lineedit.fs) and the SDL console window with colors (ports/posix/sdl2_console*.fs)
  - bare-metal AArch64 port for QEMU and the Raspberry Pi 3/4 (ports/rpi/)
  - UEFI port for x86-64 PCs (ports/efi/)

Files adapted from upstream carry both the original notice and a line
"Modifications Copyright 2026 Luginfo10".

